# Musicplayer

This repository contains the Musicplayer GTK3 desktop application.

The application source and build files are in [`musicplayer/`](musicplayer/).
See the [project README](musicplayer/README) for build instructions and
details about the Cairo/Pango title scroller, playlist, statistics, and
visualizer plugins.

To build and test from the project directory:

```sh
cd musicplayer
make
make -C tests check
```
